# D-06-08: the change-risk selection state file (session.ChangeState) is
# deliberately local-only, never committed. It normally lives under
# os.UserCacheDir()/lang-verify, outside this repository entirely; this
# entry also guards any accidental fallback path under the repo root. A
# no-diff commit can still change effective risk through toolchain drift,
# and a committed baseline would import cross-machine staleness -- so the
# first run on any machine is deliberately cold, never pre-seeded.
risklane-state.json
